### Customer Profile API Testing
### Updated according to new requirements:
### - Customer can add/edit UserName, PhoneNumber, Address
### - Customer can add vehicles and delete them (NO EDIT)
### - Loyalty points are READ-ONLY for customers

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5093
@token = your_jwt_token_here
@userId = your_user_id_here
@vehicleId = 1

### =====================================================
### Authentication (Get Token First)
### =====================================================

### 1. Register New Customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testcustomer@example.com",
  "password": "Test123!",
  "role": "Customer"
}

### 2. Login to Get Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testcustomer@example.com",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

# Copy the accessToken from response and paste it in @token variable above
# Copy the userId from the JWT token and paste in @userId variable above

### =====================================================
### Profile Management (Customer Self-Service)
### =====================================================

### 3. Get My Profile (Authenticated Customer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected Response:
# {
#   "userID": "string-guid",
#   "userName": "testcustomer@example.com",
#   "email": "testcustomer@example.com",
#   "phoneNumber": null,
#   "address": null,
#   "loyaltyPoints": 0,
#   "createdAt": "2025-11-08T...",
#   "vehicles": []
# }

### 4. Update My Profile (UserName, PhoneNumber, Address)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "John Doe",
  "phoneNumber": "0771234567",
  "address": "123 Main Street, Colombo, Sri Lanka"
}

### 5. Update Only Phone Number
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "0779876543"
}

### 6. Update Only Address
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "456 New Address, Galle, Sri Lanka"
}

### 7. Clear Address (Set to Null)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": ""
}

### =====================================================
### Vehicle Management (Customer Self-Service)
### =====================================================

### 8. Add Vehicle #1 (Toyota)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Axio",
  "year": "2017",
  "vin": "1HGBH41JXMN109186",
  "plateNumber": "CAC-4455",
  "company": "Toyota"
}

### 9. Add Vehicle #2 (Honda)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Civic",
  "year": "2020",
  "vin": "2HGFC2F59LH123456",
  "plateNumber": "ABC-1234",
  "company": "Honda"
}

### 10. Add Vehicle #3 (Without Company - Optional Field)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Prius",
  "year": "2018",
  "vin": "JTDKN3DU5A0123456",
  "plateNumber": "XYZ-7890"
}

### 11. Try to Add Duplicate VIN (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Another Car",
  "year": "2019",
  "vin": "1HGBH41JXMN109186",
  "plateNumber": "DUP-0000",
  "company": "Test"
}

### 12. Get Profile with All Vehicles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Delete Vehicle (Use vehicleId from response)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =====================================================
### Admin/Employee Operations (Requires Admin/Employee Role)
### =====================================================

### 14. Get Specific Customer Profile (Admin/Employee)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Update Specific Customer Profile (Admin/Employee)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "Updated Name",
  "phoneNumber": "0771111111",
  "address": "Updated Address"
}

### 16. Add Vehicle to Specific Customer (Admin/Employee)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/{{userId}}/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Corolla",
  "year": "2021",
  "vin": "5YFBURHE5LP123789",
  "plateNumber": "EMP-9999",
  "company": "Toyota"
}

### 17. Delete Vehicle from Specific Customer (Admin/Employee)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/{{userId}}/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =====================================================
### Error Cases to Test
### =====================================================

### 18. Try to Access Without Token (Should Fail - 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile

### 19. Try to Access Another Customer's Profile (Should Fail - 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/another-user-id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. Try to Update Another Customer's Profile (Should Fail - 403 Forbidden)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/another-user-id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "Hacker"
}

### 21. Try to Delete Another Customer's Vehicle (Should Fail - 404 Not Found)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/vehicles/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =====================================================
### Notes
### =====================================================
# 
# Customer Capabilities:
# ✅ View own profile with all vehicles and loyalty points
# ✅ Update UserName (can add or edit)
# ✅ Update PhoneNumber (can add or edit)
# ✅ Update Address (can add, edit, or clear)
# ✅ Add new vehicles (unlimited)
# ✅ Delete own vehicles (if no appointments)
# ❌ CANNOT edit vehicle details (design choice)
# ❌ CANNOT modify loyalty points (read-only)
#
# Admin/Employee Additional Capabilities:
# ✅ View any customer's profile
# ✅ Update any customer's profile
# ✅ Add vehicles to any customer
# ✅ Delete vehicles from any customer
#
# Security Features:
# 🔒 All endpoints require JWT authentication
# 🔒 Customers can only access their own data
# 🔒 Admin/Employee can access all customer data
# 🔒 VIN uniqueness validation
# 🔒 Vehicle deletion blocked if appointments exist
#
